        "pinyin": "Tā wéirén huòdá-dàdù, cóng bù wèile wēibùzúdào de xiǎoshì jīnjīn-jìjiào.",
        "en": "He is open-minded and generous, never quibbling over trivialities."
      }
    }
  ],
  "grammarNotes": [
    {
      "pattern": "世人皆知...却往往不知...",
      "explanation": "Rhetorical contrast highlighting a widespread common misconception against an overlooked profound truth (Everyone knows X, but rarely realizes Y).",
      "exampleFromStory": "世人皆知有用之用，却往往不知‘无用之用’才是保全生命的无上智慧。",
      "additionalExamples": [
        "世人皆知财富的光鲜，却往往不知守护财富背后所承受的沉重代价。",
        "世人皆知言语的犀利，却往往不知沉默中所蕴含的巨大力量。"
      ],
      "exampleFromStoryEn": "Everyone knows the use of the useful, yet few realize that 'the use of the useless' is the supreme wisdom for preserving life.",
      "additionalExamplesEn": [
        "Everyone knows the glamour of wealth, yet few realize the heavy price paid to guard it.",
        "Everyone knows the sharpness of words, yet few realize the immense power held in silence."
      ]
    },
    {
      "pattern": "何尝不是一种...",
      "explanation": "Double negative rhetorical question affirming that X is indeed a legitimate form of Y (Is this not indeed a kind of...?).",
      "exampleFromStory": "给生命留出一片空白，何尝不是抵抗时代焦虑最深刻的自救？",
      "additionalExamples": [
        "在喧闹中选择独处，何尝不是一种成熟的心灵修行？",
        "失败后坦然认输，何尝不是一种需要极大勇气的豁达？"
      ],
      "exampleFromStoryEn": "Leaving a blank space in life — isn't that the deepest way to save yourself from the anxiety of our age?",
      "additionalExamplesEn": [
        "Choosing solitude amid the noise — isn't that a mature kind of spiritual practice?",
        "Gracefully admitting defeat after failing — isn't that a broad-mindedness that takes great courage?"
      ]
    }
